    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Effective control of blood pressure can reduce the risk of stroke by 25 per cent. This was a major outcome of the public awareness programme held to mark the \"World Stroke Day\" jointly organised by Aga Khan University (AKU) and Pakistan Stroke Society at AKU on April 16.",
